    "Global acquisition distance, priority/selection/cooldowns, pathfinding, damage scaling and impulses remain Minecraft adaptations.",
    "Original projectile patterns, mount points and guidance are not fully ported.",
    "P2 FIG behavior is not yet reliably decoded; Goliath original attack curves remain disabled.",
    "Mother down-state duration is sequential clip-span adaptation; original dynamic exit conditions remain unported."
  ],
